---
/**
 * Favicon, touch icon and manifest links, shared by every page's <head>
 * (Base layout, the root language gate and the root 404). All the files are
 * generated from the logo geometry by `npm run icons`.
 *
 * favicon.ico comes first with an explicit 32x32 size, so browsers that
 * understand SVG icons still prefer favicon.svg (which also switches to a
 * light ring in dark mode) and older ones fall back to the .ico.
 */
---

<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="32x32" />
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/icons/apple-touch-icon.png" />
<link rel="manifest" href="/site.webmanifest" />
